{"id":1749317,"retrievedAt":"2026-08-15T11:40:58.171Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[],"homepage":"","id":1749317,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Plan Cinta","overview":"# Plan Cinta  The story follows Nizam's various attempts to win the heart of Alisya, the younger sister of his best friend. Alisya studies abroad and returns home for a six-month semester break to celebrate her brother Ismadi's wedding. Not wanting to waste time, Alisya chooses to work part-time as a school teacher to support her expenses for her studies overseas. A chance encounter with Nizam in a park resulting from an unexpected incident sparks romantic feelings between them, though both deny these feelings. Nizam truly falls for Alisya when he takes photographs at Ismadi and Mira's engagement ceremony. Winning Alisya's heart becomes easier when Rahmah, Alisya's mother, supports Nizam's intentions. Rahmah does not want Alisya to settle abroad permanently after she finishes her studies. Besides having to keep their relationship secret from Ismadi, their relationship is disrupted when Alisya also attracts the attention of Teacher Irsyad.","popularity":0.0143,"poster_path":"/A6rBUKdtSNc3vkHQOMLyKIfIBuF.jpg","production_companies":[{"id":105764,"logo_path":null,"name":"Mache Allstar United Sdn Bhd","origin_country":""}],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"2018-01-01","revenue":0,"runtime":0,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Plan Cinta","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":1783275,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Redza Rosli","original_name":"Redza Rosli","popularity":0.6631,"profile_path":"/jVy2yPTAg65R2p1jtJ9FZUKFG00.jpg","cast_id":2,"character":"","credit_id":"6a7f07c32c99e3572ae70e7d","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":17415